<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts AT&amp;T estimates.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts AT&amp;T estimates.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said in a research note it cut its 1997 estimates for AT&amp;T to $2.55 from $2.80, and to $2.70 from $2.95 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Still intermediate term neutral, long-term accumulate on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Daniel Reingold said disappointing Q1 AT&amp;T results portend bad news for entire long distance industry, showing pricing pressures even worse than expected.</p>
</text>
